paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/d0f63c7ad8f3ca6b655a43645b873837.poster.avif?t=1757650805\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/d0f63c7ad8f3ca6b655a43645b873837.webm?t=1757650805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/d0f63c7ad8f3ca6b655a43645b873837.mp4?t=1757650805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/b202c016c126de187320d2dd0b2f1f22.poster.avif?t=1757650805\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/b202c016c126de187320d2dd0b2f1f22.webm?t=1757650805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/b202c016c126de187320d2dd0b2f1f22.mp4?t=1757650805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIFFICULTY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UMPB has 3 difficulty settings to choose from as well as the game adjusting the difficulty automatically based on the numbers of players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from 6 characters, each with their own style, back story and motivation for fighting the enemy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/c2cd5d5c498a32d286aba93d678f1e2a.poster.avif?t=1757650805\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/c2cd5d5c498a32d286aba93d678f1e2a.webm?t=1757650805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/c2cd5d5c498a32d286aba93d678f1e2a.mp4?t=1757650805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SHIPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from 4 ships  (that also convert to Mechs for certain levels). Each ship has different attributes at the start of the game, and can be upgraded or downgraded throughout the game. There are 4 ship attributes, Attack, Defence, Revive and Speed. In addition to the 4 attributes, each ship is equipped with missiles, mines, speed boosts, shields and freeze rays (depending on the level).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/faac6576e866b00385617240c1db5096.poster.avif?t=1757650805\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/faac6576e866b00385617240c1db5096.webm?t=1757650805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/extras/faac6576e866b00385617240c1db5096.mp4?t=1757650805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE LAB</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lab is where ships can be upgraded or downgraded. The in-game resource (or currency) \u201cKrytanium\u201d is used to manufacture upgraded parts for the ships. &quot;Krytanium&quot; is collected from fallen enemies or from downgrading attributes of your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ENEMIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies range from rapid fighters that lock onto a specific player, to large slow-moving beasts that drop special weapons that will impact the player\u2019s controls or speed. Employ different tactics depending on the enemy type. For example, some enemies are impervious to the basic player weapons and can only be damaged by player missiles and mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16-BIT MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle between a modern look and a classic 16-bit look. Players can start the game this way, or change mid-game in the pause menu!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UMPB trailer and in-game music credit - Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game by Carlos Silva &amp; Tim Coulter</p>","developers":["Solindie Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282600/header.jpg?t=1757650805","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel, Apple M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated or Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Xbox controller or Direct Input compatible controller. Runs 1920x1080</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel, Apple M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated or Int